pgAdmin থেকে hisabji database select করুন।
Tools → Query Tool খুলুন।
এই query চালান:

SELECT
    identifier,
    COUNT(*) AS failed_attempts,
    MIN(created_at) AS first_attempt,
    MAX(created_at) AS last_attempt
FROM login_attempts
WHERE created_at > NOW() - INTERVAL '6 hours'
GROUP BY identifier
ORDER BY last_attempt DESC;


সব record দেখতে:

SELECT *
FROM login_attempts
ORDER BY created_at DESC;

কোনো user-এর login lock reset করতে:

DELETE FROM login_attempts
WHERE identifier = 'raselkhan';

সব login attempt reset করতে:

TRUNCATE TABLE login_attempts;

বর্তমান server বন্ধ করতে terminal-এ চাপুন:

তারপর আবার চালান:
go run ./cmd/api

